      "widgets_values": [
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Anime style matching the reference, soft volumetric lighting and floating dust motes. The shot begins exactly from <Picture 1>: the young woman with black twin braids tied by a light-blue ribbon, purple-blue eyes, green cross-collar outer robe over a white inner layer and maroon long skirt stands in the traditional bedroom, right hand lightly touching her chest, soft golden sunlight streaming through the lattice windows. She slowly lowers her hand, her expression shifting from attentive to quietly aroused. She reaches up and begins untying the side fastenings of the green outer robe with deliberate, lingering fingers. The fabric loosens and slips open, revealing the white inner layer clinging to the soft curves of her breasts. She draws the green robe off her shoulders in one continuous sensual motion, letting it slide down her arms and fall onto the edge of the bed. Without pausing she loosens the ties of the white inner layer, pulls the collar open, and shrugs it off, exposing her bare breasts and pale upper body. Her twin braids shift against her back as she cups one breast with her right hand, thumb brushing slowly over the nipple, while her left hand rests on her stomach. Her cheeks flush, eyes half-close, and lips part. She continues in a soft, breathy young female voice (S1): <d>[English] The day is finally over… these layers were so tight. Mmh… that feels so much better.</d> The camera holds a gentle medium-wide framing as she stands half-naked from the waist up in the warm shaft of sunlight, still wearing only the maroon skirt, one hand lightly holding her breast, the other on her hip, chest rising and falling with slow breaths through the end of the video.\n\noverall_soundscape: Soft room tone of the quiet traditional chamber continues throughout. Gentle fabric rustle and soft sliding sounds as the robes are untied and removed, a faint wooden creak from the floorboards when she shifts her weight, quiet breathing that grows slightly heavier and more audible, and the almost inaudible whisper of dust motes in the light beams.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Sparse, slow solo piano notes with long intimate decay, joined by a very low sustained string drone that remains quiet and sensual, fading gently at the end."
